{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_12\">Problem 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\tWhat is the derivative of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c2880792f964462f1faa651a0cadbe4dd77ba295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^{2}\\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p>\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7c3aae654fa35e83188b7a25a78f58b2e044a77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ f&#39;(x) = 2x\\cos x + x^{2}\\sin x  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ f&#39;(x) = 2x \\sin x  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ f&#39;(x) = 2x\\cos x - x^{2} \\sin x  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ f&#39;(x) = -2x \\sin x  \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ f&#39;(x) = 2x\\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1030\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the product rule,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a1485331c219f6aa5a56162953ee21b069a93cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f&#39;(x) = x^{2} \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}\\left[ \\cos x \\right] + \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}\\left[ x^{2} \\right] \\cdot \\cos x \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ f&#39;(x) = 2x\\cos x - x^{2} \\sin x}\\]\" width=\"581\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calc